This README file contains information on the contents of the meta-egf-swupdate layer.

Please see the corresponding sections below for details.

Dependencies
============

  URI: https://github.com/sbabic/meta-swupdate.git
  branch: scarthgap

Patches
=======

Please submit any patches against the meta-egf-swupdate layer to the maintainer:

Maintainer: Mauro Salvini <mauro.salvini@elettronicagf.it>

